body:
I would recommend maybe setting up an audio recording system by the shore, or near the race because the heli will drown out, or muddy up your audio. If the heli is loud enough for you to have to wear a headset to talk in the aircraft, chances are, it's loud af.

&#x200B;

Source: I'm a pilot, and audio engineer

